@startuml
title A-COP Basement(Core) component architecture
left to right direction
skinparam backgroundColor #faf9ff
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam ArrowColor #4b5563
skinparam LineColor #4b5563
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor #f5f3ff
  BorderColor #7c3aed
  FontColor #111827
  BackgroundColor<<core1>> #dbeafe
  BorderColor<<core1>> #2563eb
  BackgroundColor<<core2>> #fee2e2
  BorderColor<<core2>> #dc2626
  BackgroundColor<<broker>> #e0e7ff
  BorderColor<<broker>> #4f46e5
  BackgroundColor<<context>> #cffafe
  BorderColor<<context>> #0891b2
  BackgroundColor<<domain>> #dcfce7
  BorderColor<<domain>> #16a34a
}
skinparam package {
  BackgroundColor #ffffff
  BorderColor #6b7280
  BackgroundColor<<core1>> #eff6ff
  BorderColor<<core1>> #2563eb
  BackgroundColor<<core2>> #fff1f2
  BorderColor<<core2>> #dc2626
  BackgroundColor<<domain>> #f0fdf4
  BorderColor<<domain>> #16a34a
}

component "REST / MCP\n진입" as RestMcp
component "A2A Remote\n외부 Agent" as ExternalA2A
component "운영 UI" as OpsUI
component "LLM provider" as LLM
database "DB" as DB

package "CS Pack" <<domain>> as CSPack {
  component "VOC & Store Manager" as VOC
  component "Response Generation & Review" as Response
}
package "Commerce Ops Pack" <<domain>> as CommercePack {
  component "Procurement + Order & Payment" as Procurement
  component "Fulfillment & Logistics" as Fulfillment
  component "Return & Refund (Mock)" as Return
  component "Catalog & Verification\n(A2A Remote)" as Catalog
}

package "Core 1. Case Runtime & Coordination" <<core1>> as Core1 {
  component "Agent Gateway" as Gateway
  component "Customer Case Layer" as CaseLayer
  component "Agent Team Registry /\nTeam Contract" as Registry
  component "Context Broker" <<context>> as Context
  component "Message Broker" <<broker>> as Message
  component "Shared State" as State
  component "Agentic Controller /\nOrchestration" as Controller
}

package "Core 2. Access & Action Platform" <<core2>> as Core2 {
  component "Tool / Action Layer" as Action
}

RestMcp --> Gateway : REST / MCP 요청
ExternalA2A --> Gateway : A2A 요청
OpsUI --> Gateway : 운영 접근
Gateway --> CaseLayer : 승인된 요청
Gateway --> Controller : Case / Task 진입
CaseLayer --> State : Case 상태·event/history
Controller --> Registry : capability resolve
Registry --> Controller : Team Contract / 실행 유형
Controller --> Context : Context 요청
Context --> Controller : ContextPack
Context --> DB : RAG·DB 상태·이력·Memory 조회
Controller --> Message : Task / Event publish
Message --> VOC : 전달
Message --> Response : 전달
Message --> Procurement : 전달
Message --> Fulfillment : 전달
Message --> Return : 전달
Message --> State : event 반영
Controller --> Action : ActionProposal
Action --> DB : 승인·idempotency·audit 상태
Action --> ExternalA2A : A2A Remote 위임
Controller --> LLM : 판단·응답 생성

VOC -[hidden]-> Response
Procurement -[hidden]-> Fulfillment
Core1 -[hidden]-> Core2

note right of Message
Message Broker = Task/Event 전달
Queue·Retry·Event 운반만 수행
Team 선택이나 판단은 하지 않는다.
end note

note right of Context
Context Broker = 판단용 ContextPack 구성
RAG, DB current state, Case history,
Memory, Team knowledge scope를
선택·조합·정규화·압축한다.
Message Broker와 합치지 않는다.
end note

note bottom of Core2
Core 2는 Tool/Action, approval,
idempotency, audit와 실제 side effect를 담당한다.
Core 1의 Team은 ActionProposal만 반환한다.
end note

note top of Core1
CS Pack과 Commerce Ops Pack은
하나의 Runtime(Core) 위에 얹히는
Registry 등록형 도메인 팩이다.
end note

legend bottom right
|색상|의미|
|<#eff6ff>|Core 1: Case Runtime & Coordination|
|<#fff1f2>|Core 2: Access & Action Platform|
|<#f0fdf4>|도메인 팩 / Registry 등록 Team|
|<#e0e7ff>|Message Broker: Task/Event 전달|
|<#cffafe>|Context Broker: 판단용 ContextPack|
endlegend
@enduml
